    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Discover the beauty of Santa Rosa Beach from this superb 10-bedroom house. With 5 king beds, 4 queen beds, and 4 twin beds, this marvelous property offers a comfortable stay for all guests.<br><br>This Brand New 10 bedroom home is nestled along the beautiful beaches of 30A.Located in one of the most desirable areas of 30A, this home boasts a private pool and spa, (pool and spa heat available for an additional fee from October- March only) along with a built in fire pit.<br><br>The main home has 5 king suits, 2 queen and one bunk room with 4 twins. Both ground floor rooms are king suits. Each room has an attached full bath as well as a ground floor half bath with a door to the pool.<br><br>The carriage home has 2 queen suits on the second floor with attached bathrooms. Downstairs you will find a lounge with 83” tv and mini fridge, along with extra dining seating. Also attached is a game room with an inside/outside bar with a roll up door. Inside is a ping pong table and dart board along with some seating and barstools.<br><br>This home is sure to meet everyone’s needs and comfortably sleeps 22 in beds. <br><br>The neighborhood has deeded beach access and is only a block away from long leaf trail which is a 13 mile nature trail that runs throughout point Washington. <br><br>6 passenger lithium golf cart included.",
